{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And behold, YHWH</b> — four times in the Masorah: והנה ה' נצב עליו. והנה ה' נצב על חומת אנך. והנה ה' עושה ארובות בשמים. ה\"נ כתיב וזה שער השמים and likewise והנה ה' עובר. Since it treats the Chariot, here too 'and behold a ladder set upon the earth' is in the matter of the Chariot." "<b>and the Elohim of Isaac</b> — wonder, why did He not say 'the Elohim of Isaac your father' as with Abraham? And some say: because with Abraham He said 'I am YHWH,' He said 'the Elohim of Abraham your father'; and with Isaac, since He did not say 'I am YHWH,' He did not say 'your father.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:18.010332705Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}